  "rationale": "Both supplied evidence items (provider-player, native-source-chapters) identify the recording only as 'The League of Women Voters Candidate Forum' on April 17, 2025 (recording 340514, retrieved 2026-10-11). That label names a candidate-forum program, not a convened City of Denton municipal body; per the instructions no formal municipal institution may be established from a program label, and the League of Women Voters' convening role appears only within the title, not in ownership evidence. No existing Denton feed matches a candidate forum, and topic proximity to Council elections does not create City Council membership under the identity policy (convened body, not venue, topic, or common members). The general series policy states that candidate forums remain archival series, not Council proceedings, so the approved disposition is archive_series with no body feed. The empty feed membership reflects the approved archival-series disposition and the absent ownership evidence; it does not declare the recording non-government. If city sponsorship or a convening municipal body is later documented, that body would need to be named with its own evidence."
